  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O ye children of Benjamin, gather yourselves to flee out of the midst of Jerusalem, and blow the trumpet in Tekoa, and set up a sign of fire in Beth-haccerem: for evil appeareth out of the north, and great destruction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have likened the daughter of Zion to a comely and delicate",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "woman",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The shepherds with their flocks shall come unto her; they shall pitch",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tents against her round about; they shall feed every one in his place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prepare ye war against her; arise, and let us go up at noon. Woe unto us! for the day goeth away, for the shadows of the evening are stretched out.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arise, and let us go by night, and let us destroy her palaces.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ For thus hath the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts said, Hew ye down trees, and cast a mount against Jerusalem: this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the city to be visited; she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wholly oppression in the midst of her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a fountain casteth out her waters, so she casteth out her wickedness: violence and spoil is heard in her; before me continually",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "grief and wounds.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be thou instructed, O Jerusalem, lest my soul depart from thee; lest I make thee desolate, a land not inhabited.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts, They shall throughly glean the remnant of Israel as a vine: turn back thine hand as a grapegatherer into the baskets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To whom shall I speak, and give warning, that they may hear? behold, their ear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uncircumcised, and they cannot hearken: behold, the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is unto them a reproach; they have no delight in it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore I am full of the fury of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; I am weary with holding in: I will pour it out upon the children abroad, and upon the assembly of young men together: for even the husband with the wife shall be taken, the aged with",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "full of days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And their houses shall be turned unto others,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fields and wives together: for I will stretch out my hand upon the inhabitants of the land, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For from the least of them even unto the greatest of them every one",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "given to covetousness; and from the prophet even unto the priest every one dealeth falsely.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have healed also the hurt",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of the daughter",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of my people slightly, saying, Peace, peace; when",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no peace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were they ashamed when they had committed abomination? nay, they were not at all ashamed, neither could they blush: therefore they shall fall among them that fall: at the time",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I visit them they shall be cast down, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Stand ye in the ways, and see, and ask for the old paths, where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the good way, and walk therein, and ye shall find rest for your souls. But they said, We will not walk",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
