          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also I set watchmen over you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Hearken to the sound of the trumpet. But they said, We will not hearken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Therefore hear, ye nations, and know, O congregation, what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "among them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear, O earth: behold, I will bring evil upon this people,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the fruit of their thoughts, because they have not hearkened unto my words, nor to my law, but rejected it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To what purpose cometh there to me incense from Sheba, and the sweet cane from a far country? your burnt offerings",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not acceptable, nor your sacrifices sweet unto me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Behold, I will lay stumblingblocks before this people, and the fathers and the sons together shall fall upon them; the neighbour and his friend shall perish.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Behold, a people cometh from the north country, and a great nation shall be raised from the sides of the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall lay hold on bow and spear; they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cruel, and have no mercy; their voice roareth like the sea; and they ride upon horses, set in array as men for war against thee, O daughter of Zion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We have heard the fame thereof: our hands wax feeble: anguish hath taken hold of us,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pain, as of a woman in travail.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go not forth into the field, nor walk by the way; for the sword of the enemy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.6.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.6.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
